{"id":"407cbcc3fb925fed","group":"67","path":"67/67-thm-lob.md","title":"Löb Theorem","display":"thm-lob — Löb Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-thm-lob","aliases":["67-thm-lob"],"display":"thm-lob — Löb Theorem","depends_on":["[[67-df-PA]]","[[67-df-provability-conditions]]","[[67-thm-fixed-point-lemma]]","[[67-df-sentence]]"],"source_edition":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"source_chapter":2,"source_label":"Theorem 6","source_printed_pages":28,"source_pdf_pages":39,"source_proof_status":"陈述及下述本地推导已复核；未作机器证明"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-thm-lob"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-thm-lob</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-lob — Löb Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"cd051851df5d2aa2\" href=\"?note=cd051851df5d2aa2\" title=\"67-df-PA\">67-df-PA</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8c48c66841a15eb9\" href=\"?note=8c48c66841a15eb9\" title=\"67-df-provability-conditions\">67-df-provability-conditions</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f76c99f69499336d\" href=\"?note=f76c99f69499336d\" title=\"67-thm-fixed-point-lemma\">67-thm-fixed-point-lemma</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"854772391cef4007\" href=\"?note=854772391cef4007\" title=\"67-df-sentence\">67-df-sentence</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"source_chapter","html":"2"},{"key":"source_label","html":"Theorem 6"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"28"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"39"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"陈述及下述本地推导已复核；未作机器证明"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(T\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P(v)\">\\(P(v)\\)</span> 为一元算术公式并满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8c48c66841a15eb9\" href=\"?note=8c48c66841a15eb9\" title=\"67-df-provability-conditions\">67-df-provability-conditions</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BL}(T,P)\">\\(\\mathrm{BL}(T,P)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_\\varphi=P(\\overline{g(\\varphi)})\">\\(P_\\varphi=P(\\overline{g(\\varphi)})\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\)</span>；自然编号和固定点见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"f76c99f69499336d\" href=\"?note=f76c99f69499336d\" title=\"67-thm-fixed-point-lemma\">67-thm-fixed-point-lemma</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(T\\vdash(P_\\varphi\\to\\varphi))\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ T\\vdash\\varphi.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(T\\vdash(P_\\varphi\\to\\varphi))\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ T\\vdash\\varphi.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Theorem 2.6, p.28。取 θ 使 PA⊢θ↔(P_θ→φ)。由 BL 得到 T⊢P_θ→P_φ；假设 T⊢P_φ→φ，故 T⊢P_θ→φ，继而 T⊢θ。BLi 给出 PA⊢P_θ，最后推出 T⊢φ。这一证明无须另加外部一致性。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-PA","status":"resolved","id":"cd051851df5d2aa2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnc